<div class="horizontal-scroll-shadow"></div></div></div></div>
<div class="tabbed-contents">
<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-pre-raid-opening" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">This list represents the best gear available in Mists of Pandaria Classic prior to Mogu'Shan Vaults opening and Celestial Dungeons becoming available. This includes world drop BoE items as well as some rare Dungeon epics.<br/>
<br/>
