<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-msv-release" role="tabpanel" style="display: none;" tabindex="0">This list represents the best overall gear available from the first wave of Celestial Dungeons in Mists of Pandaria Classic Phase 1. This includes additional gear from <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, as well as items bought with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=3350/august-stone-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="August Stone Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_legendarygem_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">August Stone Fragment</span></span></a>. Note that <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=104390/enchant-bracer-exceptional-strength">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Exceptional Strength</span></a> becomes available as a bracer enchant.<br/>
