<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-toes-release" role="tabpanel" style="display: none;" tabindex="0">This list represents the best overall gear available from the third wave of Celestial Dungeons in Mists of Pandaria Classic Phase 1. This offers a new trinket in <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=86894/darkmist-vortex">
<img alt="Darkmist Vortex" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/creatureportrait_cyclone_nodebris.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkmist Vortex</span></a> and unlocks your 4-piece tier bonus.<br/>
