<del></del></span> Best Reputation Items for Frost Death Knights</span></h2>Reputation gear can be very strong, but it can also be difficult to choose which factions to prioritize first. As a Frost Death Knight, we recommend you prioritize <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1269/golden-lotus">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Golden Lotus</span></a> to get your hands on <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89345/stonetoe-spaulders">
