<img alt="Reins of the Azure Riding Crane" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_mount_cranemountblue.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reins of the Azure Riding Crane</span></a>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87783/reins-of-the-regal-riding-crane">
<img alt="Reins of the Regal Riding Crane" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_mount_cranemountpurple.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reins of the Regal Riding Crane</span></a>
